{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21692","headline":"酬乐天得稹所寄紵丝布白轻庸制成衣服以诗报之 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天得稹所寄紵丝布白轻庸制成衣服以诗报之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湓城万里隔巴庸，紵薄绨轻共一封。\n腰带定知今瘦小，衣衫难作远裁缝。\n唯愁书到炎凉变，忽见诗来意绪浓。\n春草绿茸云色白，想君骑马好仪容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}